{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the world of Dracamar!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a 3D platformer adventure and fight King Crad, the evil dragon who wants to conquer the world of Dracamar. Run, jump, and battle to rescue the magical Okis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Catalan culture inspires the world of Dracamar, and the game is available to play in Catalan.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557640/extras/Dracamar_Highlight_02.png?t=1742834493\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Friends that travel together, stay together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel and explore all the islands and free the Okis. Collect Moki-balls and use their energy to rebuild the bridges and connect the islands again.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557640/extras/Dracamar_Highlight_04.png?t=1742834493\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Heroes come in all shapes and sizes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iko is a very special Oki. He will follow you on your adventures and help you defeat King Crad with his magical powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557640/extras/Dracamar_Highlight_03.png?t=1742834493\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautifully-rendered graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Playable character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a complete level of the game for free, full of enemies, traps, and puzzles.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover all kinds of hidden gems, challenges, and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to delight and challenge players of all ages and skill levels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s Included in the Demo?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First Level \u2013 Explore the opening island of the game, where you\u2019ll start to rescue Okis and learn the core mechanics, including movement, jumping, and battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s not in the Demo?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All 15 levels of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Final Boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local Co-Op</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A production by </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557640/extras/3Cat_negatiu_200.png?t=1742834493\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">in collaboration with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557640/extras/petoons_studio_logo_150.png?t=1742834493\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557640?t=1742834493","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557640/c66727fe213092cc22c996b4e92ae2276130e63a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742834493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557640/ee2d688232cffe10558d8f57d129ad443376089f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742834493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557640/ee2d688232cffe10558d8f57d129ad443376089f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742834493","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"not